{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And I will turn to you.</b> I will turn from all My affairs to pay your reward. To what may the matter be compared? To a king who hired laborers, etc. — as is in Torat Kohanim." "<b>And I will make you fruitful.</b> In fruitfulness and multiplication." "<b>And I will multiply you.</b> In upright stature (Sifra)." "<b>And I will establish My covenant with you.</b> A new covenant — not like the first covenant which you violated, but a new covenant that shall not be violated, as it is said (Jeremiah 31) ״וְכָרַתִּי אֶת בֵּית יִשְׂרָאֵל וְאֶת בֵּית יְהוּדָה בְּרִית חֲדָשָׁה לֹא כַבְּרִית וגו׳״ (Sifra)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {0 "ת\"כֹ = Torat Kohanim (Sifra)."}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:08:36.994558376Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}